[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9361.59, "timestamp": "02:36:01", "text": "像是发给你的，但实际上并非如此"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9364.91, "timestamp": "02:36:04", "text": "凡是有注明是粉丝制作的地方都写着。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9368.87, "timestamp": "02:36:08", "text": "东西。所以事情的经过是这样的："}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9371.03, "timestamp": "02:36:11", "text": "发布在 YouTube 和 SoundCloud 上"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9372.71, "timestamp": "02:36:12", "text": "到处"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9375.19, "timestamp": "02:36:15", "text": "呃，当有些人看着"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9377.67, "timestamp": "02:36:17", "text": "Soundcloud 和类似 Sound Yeah 之类的平台。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9378.87, "timestamp": "02:36:18", "text": "SoundCloud 和他们搞的那些东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9381.03, "timestamp": "02:36:21", "text": "推荐给他们，他们也觉得"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9384.389, "timestamp": "02:36:24", "text": "问我乔，你什么时候做音乐的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9387.429, "timestamp": "02:36:27", "text": "然后我和这个人合作"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9389.91, "timestamp": "02:36:29", "text": "得知此事后，我当时就懵了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9397.75, "timestamp": "02:36:37", "text": "所以，是的，就像那样，无论是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9399.75, "timestamp": "02:36:39", "text": "来自类似直播的声音等等"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9402.309, "timestamp": "02:36:42", "text": "现在总得有人喜欢他们。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9406.07, "timestamp": "02:36:46", "text": "提到没有从流媒体中提取任何声音"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9410.71, "timestamp": "02:36:50", "text": "等等，这是一个粉丝自制项目，并非……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9418.55, "timestamp": "02:36:58", "text": "这很可疑。"}]